se},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false}},{"name":"rust.manifest.patch","description":"Preview, commit or inspect a journaled semantic root Cargo.toml edit. Host --allow-manifest-write is required. Preview validates the exact candidate in the approved offline Cargo runtime and returns its diff/digest. New effects require an unexpired approved plan and an idempotency key. Exact ID/digest/key can replay an existing journal under current authority. Commit invalidates its input project_ref: call rust.project.open and use its newly returned data.project_ref for ALL later calls, including receipt/recovery; never reuse the precommit reference. Local coordinated writes do not exclude external editors or provide multi-file atomicity. Supports closed feature, built-in profile setting, workspace dependency and package/workspace rust/clippy lint set/remove. Dependency resolution requires host-approved offline vendor data and preserves whether Cargo.lock exists.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"action":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Action"},"project_ref":{"pattern":"^prj_[0-9a-f]{32}$","type":"string"}},"required":["project_ref","action"],"$defs":{"Action":{"oneOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"edit":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Edit"},"expected_project_fingerprint":{"pattern":"^sha256:[0-9a-f]{64}$","type":"string"},"mode":{"const":"preview","type":"string"}},"required":["mode","expected_project_fingerprint","edit"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"idempotency_key":{"maxLength":64,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9_-]+$","type":"string"},"mode":{"const":"commit","type":"string"},"plan_digest":{"pattern":"^sha256:[0-9a-f]{64}$","type":"string"},"plan_id":{"pattern":"^mut_[0-9a-f]{32}$","type":"string"}},"required":["mode","plan_id","plan_digest","idempotency_key"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"mode":{"const":"receipt","type":"string"},"operation_