int":false,"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false}},{"name":"rust.fmt.apply","description":"Preview, commit or inspect a journaled rustfmt operation on existing Rust source files. Host --allow-fmt-write is required. Preview runs rustfmt in the approved offline sandbox, verifies fmt.check against the complete exported candidate, and returns its exact diff/digest without source writes. New effects require an unexpired approved plan and an idempotency key. Exact ID/digest/key can replay an existing journal under current authority. Commit invalidates its input project_ref: call rust.project.open and use its newly returned data.project_ref for ALL later calls, including receipt/recovery; never reuse the precommit reference. Local coordinated publication does not exclude external editors or provide multi-file atomicity.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"action":{"$ref":"#/$defs/FormatAction"},"project_ref":{"pattern":"^prj_[0-9a-f]{32}$","type":"string"}},"required":["project_ref","action"],"$defs":{"FormatAction":{"oneOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"expected_project_fingerprint":{"pattern":"^sha256:[0-9a-f]{64}$","type":"string"},"mode":{"const":"preview","type":"string"}},"required":["mode","expected_project_fingerprint"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"idempotency_key":{"maxLength":64,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9_-]+$","type":"string"},"mode":{"const":"commit","type":"string"},"plan_digest":{"pattern":"^sha256:[0-9a-f]{64}$","type":"string"},"plan_id":{"pattern":"^mut_[0-9a-f]{32}$","type":"string"}},"required":["mode","plan_id","plan_digest","idempotency_key"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"mode":{"const":"receipt","type":"string"},"operation_id":{"pattern":"^mut_[0-9a-f]{32}$","type":"string"},"recover":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["mode","operation_id","recover"],"type":"object"}]}},"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schem