ema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"title":"Output"},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false}},{"name":"rust.fix.apply","description":"Preview, commit or inspect a journaled cargo fix operation on existing Rust source. Host --allow-fix-write is required. The fixed offline sandbox command selects all workspace targets and default features, then independently checks the complete candidate. Project build scripts and proc macros may influence permitted source changes; review the exact diff. No edition migration, broken-code or arbitrary flags. New effects require an unexpired approved plan and an idempotency key. Exact ID/digest/key can replay an existing journal under current authority. Commit invalidates its input project_ref: call rust.project.open and use its newly returned data.project_ref for ALL later calls, including receipt/recovery; never reuse the precommit reference. Local coordinated publication does not exclude external editors or provide multi-file atomicity.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"action":{"$ref":"#/$defs/FormatAction"},"project_ref":{"pattern":"^prj_[0-9a-f]{32}$","type":"string"}},"required":["project_ref","action"],"$defs":{"FormatAction":{"oneOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"expected_project_fingerprint":{"pattern":"^sha256:[0-9a-f]{64}$","type":"string"},"mode":{"const":"preview","type":"string"}},"required":["mode","expected_project_fingerprint"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"idempotency_key":{"maxLength":64,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9_-]+$","type":"string"},"mode":{"const":"commit","type":"string"},"plan_digest":{"pattern":"^sha256:[0-9a-f]{64}$","type":"string"},"plan_id":{"pattern":"^mut_[0-9a-f]{32}$","type":"string"}},"required":["mode","plan_id","plan_digest","idempotency_key"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"mode":{"const":"receipt","type":"stri